{
  "bodyHash": "51489dc3b460a773",
  "content": "<h1>LDLib2</h1>\n<p><strong>一个现代化的 Minecraft 模组开发库，用于 UI、渲染、同步、持久化和游戏内编辑器。</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Low-Drag-MC/LDLib2/stargazers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/low-drag-mc/ldlib2?style=for-the-badge&logo=github\" alt=\"GitHub stars\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ldlib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/626676?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&label=CurseForge\" alt=\"CurseForge downloads\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fldlib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/ldlib?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&label=Modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth downloads\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmaven.firstdark.dev%252fsnapshots%252fcom%252flowdragmc%252fldlib2%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/maven-metadata/v?style=for-the-badge&label=latest&metadataUrl=https://maven.firstdark.dev/snapshots/com/lowdragmc/ldlib2/ldlib2-neoforge-1.21.1/maven-metadata.xml\" alt=\"Latest Maven version\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/NeoForge-21.1 -E04E14?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"NeoForge\"></a>\n<a href=\"LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/low-drag-mc/ldlib2?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"License\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">文档</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252fjava_integration.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Java 集成</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252fui%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">UI 指南</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsDdf2yD9bh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ldlib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fldlib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p>LDLib2 是对原始 <a href=\"https://github.com/Low-Drag-MC/LDLib-MultiLoader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LDLib</a> 的完全重写，围绕现代 Minecraft 和 NeoForge 开发重新设计。它为模组作者提供了一个更高级的基础，用于构建 UI、游戏内工具、基于渲染器的内容、同步数据和持久化运行时系统，而无需在每个项目中重复构建相同的基础设施。</p>\n<h2>功能亮点</h2>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td>\n\n<span><span><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ic5H3YoVPjQ?si=Qu6U8hDdl9L2kTcX\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br>\n<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252fui%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">LDLib2 UI</a></strong><br>\n使用基于 Taffy 的布局、LSS 样式表、可复用组件、XML 定义、数据绑定、RPC 事件和 HUD 覆盖层来构建 Minecraft 界面。\n</td>\n<td>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252fsync%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Low-Drag-MC/LDLib2/refs/heads/1.21/.github/readme/sync-persistence.svg\" alt=\"Data synchronization and persistence overview\"></a><br>\n<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252fsync%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">数据同步与持久化</a></strong><br>\n通过注解字段使用 <code>@Persisted</code>、<code>@DescSynced</code> 以及 RPC 辅助工具，以最小的样板代码生成 NBT IO、编解码器、脏字段同步和数据包流程。\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252fnode-graph-toolkit%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Low-Drag-MC/LowDragMC-Doc/v2/docs/en/ldlib2/node-graph-toolkit/assets/ngt-overview-placeholder.png\" alt=\"Node Graph Toolkit editor\"></a><br>\n<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252fnode-graph-toolkit%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">节点图工具包</a></strong><br>\n创建包含节点、端口、连线、变量、子图、黑板、可撤销命令和资源支持图形资产的内置游戏编辑器。\n</td>\n<td>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252feditor%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Low-Drag-MC/LowDragMC-Doc/v2/docs/en/ldlib2/editor/assets/ui_editor.png\" alt=\"LDLib2 in-game UI editor\"></a><br>\n<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252feditor%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">游戏内编辑器框架</a></strong><br>\n构建类似 Unity、Blender 或 Blockbench 的工具，支持可停靠视图、项目文件、资源浏览器、检查器、历史记录、设置和自定义编辑器面板。\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252fconfigurable%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Low-Drag-MC/LowDragMC-Doc/v2/docs/en/ldlib2/configurable/assets/configurator_example.png\" alt=\"Generated Configurable property editor\"></a><br>\n<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252fconfigurable%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">可配置属性</a></strong><br>\n将带有注解的 Java 对象转换为适合检查器的属性面板，包括范围选择、下拉列表、列表、资源位置、搜索框、撤销历史和持久化功能。\n</td>\n<td>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252fui%252fxei_support.html\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Low-Drag-MC/LDLib2/blob/1.21/.github/readme/xei.png?raw=true\" alt=\"LDLib2 XEI integration\"></a><br>\n<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252fui%252fxei_support.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">渲染与集成</a></strong><br>\n结合常用的模组开发工作流（如 JEI、REI、EMI、KubeJS 和 Java 插件入口点），使用 LDLib2 的着色器、纹理、模型渲染、场景和编辑器实用工具。\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<p>完整教程请参阅 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252fui%252fgetting_start.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">UI 入门指南</a>。</p>\n<h2>链接</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">文档</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Low-Drag-MC/LDLib2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 仓库</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ldlib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge 项目</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fldlib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth 项目</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsDdf2yD9bh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 社区</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Low-Drag-MC/LDLib-MultiLoader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">原始 LDLib</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>许可证</h2>\n<p>LDLib2 根据 <a href=\"LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LGPL-3.0 许可证</a> 授权。</p>",
